    <briefdescription>
<para>Material that colors each fragment by the value of the heatmap cell under it. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Item-local pixels map to fractional cell coordinates per dimension, by the formula that <computeroutput>columnMapping</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>rowMapping</computeroutput> select from <computeroutput><ref refid="structQAccelPlot_1_1Internal_1_1HeatmapShaderMapping_1acef8c6e21dcb32492e2b3612bb7c6cb2" kindref="member">Internal::HeatmapShaderMapping::Mode</ref></computeroutput>. The fragment shader reads the cell value from <computeroutput>values</computeroutput> and looks up its color in <computeroutput>colorMap</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
